@startuml Sequence Diagram - Cancel Subscription

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "BillingView" as BillingView
participant "ClerkAuth" as ClerkAuth
participant "Backend" as Backend

Admin -> BillingView : 1 Open billing/plan page
activate BillingView
BillingView -> BillingView : 2 Display current subscription info

Admin -> BillingView : 3 Click "Cancel Subscription" button

BillingView -> BillingView : 4 Confirm cancellation action

BillingView -> ClerkAuth : 5 Send cancellation request
activate ClerkAuth
ClerkAuth -> Backend : 6 Update subscription status
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend : 7 Update user/organization subscription record
Backend -> ClerkAuth : 8 Confirmation
ClerkAuth -> BillingView : 9 Success notification
BillingView -> Admin : 10 Display success message

deactivate Backend
deactivate ClerkAuth
deactivate BillingView

@enduml
